    "description": "Build ATS-optimised, human-sounding CVs in LaTeX (Overleaf-ready code). Trigger this skill whenever a user asks to create, rewrite, reconstruct, or improve a CV, resume, or job application document — including when they upload an existing CV, paste raw experience, or describe a target role. Also trigger when the user says things like \"make my CV better\", \"tailor my resume for X\", \"help me apply for a job\", or \"write my CV from scratch\". Always use this skill for any CV/resume task, even if the user doesn't use the word \"LaTeX\" or \"ATS\".\n",
